<title>USA: NVR Inc Q4 net income rises.</title>
<headline>NVR Inc Q4 net income rises.</headline>
<dateline>MCLEAN, Va. 1997-01-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>3 Mos ended 12/31 12 Mos ended 12/31</p>
<p>					 1996     1995     1996     1995</p>
<p>  HOMEBUILDING REVENUES	$249.5   $261.6 $1,045.9   $869.1</p>
<p>  Cost of sales		  (216.7)  (227.1)  (906.3) (751.0)</p>
<p>  NET INCOME			  5.0	4.8     25.8     17.3</p>
<p>  EPS before extraordinary gain 0.34     0.31    1.72     1.07</p>
<p>  Extraordinary gain		0.00     0.00    0.00     0.06</p>
<p>  Earnings per share		0.34     0.31    1.72     1.13</p>
<p>EPS before extraordinary gain and the amortization of excess   reorganization value	    0.48     0.45    2.27     1.60</p>
<p>		(dollars in millions, except earnings per share)</p>
<p>NOTE: (a) The non-cash amortization of excess reorganization value, related to the company's reorganization completed on September 30, 1993, negatively impacted net earnings by $2.0 million ($0.14 per share) for the three months ended December 31, 1996 and 1995, and by $8.1 million ($0.55 per share) and $8.1 million ($0.53 per share) for the years ended December 31, 1996 and 1995, respectively.</p>
